Subject: [PATCH 08/18] GOLD fast credit: credit an EMBEO top-up at block
 inclusion (~12 s) instead of finality (~15 min)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Owner decision 2026-10-26 (plan: D:\Claude\IMD Ember\GOLD快速入帳方案_2026-10-26.md). The finalized
indexer and every existing journal are unchanged; fast credit is a separate, guarded journal.

- migrations/0021: world_gold_fast_credits / _entries / _debts with SQL authority, transition and
  immutability triggers; an outstanding debt blocks GOLD service payments and mint holds; the
  history view shows a fast credit when it happens and hides the later settle pair.
- server/world-gold-fast.ts: fastCreditTopup verifies the server-fetched receipt with the indexer's
  own parser (economy-rpc economyReceiptPayment): canonical block, exact order, payer and amount;
  maintainFastGold follows a re-included payment, reverts one the finalized cursor passed unpaid
  (definite answers only; outages never revert), records the unpaid rest as a debt and collects it.
- reconcileWorldGold and admin repair-topup settle a fast credit in the same batch as the ordinary
  top-up entry (net zero); recovery's balance equation includes fast entries.
- POST /api/gold/orders/{id}/fast-credit (hash only); the Worker binds it only with GOLD_FAST_CREDIT=1,
  on its own ECONOMY_CHAIN_LIMITER key; existing fast credits are followed regardless.
- Browser: src/world/fastGoldCredit.ts follows the wallet's hash on a 90 s schedule outside the
  panel; the top bar shows "+N crediting"; the purchase page states the 12-second credit (owner-
  approved wording) and falls back to the finalized message on any refusal.

Tests: tests/world-gold-fast.test.mjs (15) and tests/fast-gold-client.test.mjs (6); seven mutation
checks (no settle, any-error revert, revert canonical, revert before finality, no amount check,
no canonical check, debt not blocking) each fail the suite. Full suite 3,593: 3,588 pass, 5 skip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
